Strategic Backbone — The Insight, the Strategic Intention, the Belief Being Built.
Creative Packet — Platform, campaign line, pillars, creative brief (flagged if missing), tone of voice, what success looks like creatively. Plus a three-component reference block: what it is / what it demonstrates / what it does not mean.
